    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14590" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπύρηνος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῡ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>without stone</i> or
				<i>kernel, pipless,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥοά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					118
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				4.13.2
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φοῖνιξ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>de An.</u>
					422a29
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				267
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>with no spine,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰχθύς</span> (i.e. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔγχελυς</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Archestr.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				8
			</span></i> codd.</div>
